# Build outputs — the package is rebuilt from source with the EWDK (README.md);
# test-signed binaries never enter history.
**/x64/
**/ARM64/
**/.vs/
*.log

# Signing artifacts — the test cert is per build machine (sign/README.md).
# The public .cer is regenerated by New-VynelTestCert.ps1 and travels with the
# package to the VM; a .pfx (private key) must NEVER be committed.
*.cer
*.pfx
